 vitali [npc=48245]\n- a summus indagatrix vocantem [npc=48246]\n- a summus praetor ledalus [npc=48247]\n- a summus praetor lucem [npc=48248]\n- a summus praetor noctis [npc=48249]\n- a supurbus praetor lucem [npc=48250]\n- a supurbus praetor noctis [npc=48251]\n- a timid indagator materia [npc=48254]\n- a timid indagator mortem [npc=48255]\n- a timid indagator vitali [npc=48260]\n- a timid indagator vocantem [npc=48261]\n- a timid indagatrix materia [npc=48256]\n- a timid indagatrix mortem [npc=48257]\n- a timid indagatrix vitali [npc=48258]\n- a timid indagatrix vocantem [npc=48259]\n- a vicarum spiritus [npc=48262]\n- a vicarum vitai [npc=48263]\n- an inanimatum vicarum spiritus [npc=48224]\n- an inanimatum vicarum vitai [npc=48225]\n- an indagator materia [npc=48269]\n- an indagator mortem [npc=48270]\n- an indagator vitali [npc=48271]\n- an indagator vocantem [npc=48272]\n- an indagatrix materia [npc=48273]\n- an indagatrix mortem [npc=48274]\n- an indagatrix vitali [npc=48275]\n- an indagatrix vocantem [npc=48276]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 04:04:56 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with Captain Mewes ( **click for map image**), located on the deck of the boat docked in the Combine Dredge._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- Minimum Level 95\n_Say \"hamper\" to request the task._\nYou say, 'Hail, Captain Mewes'\nCaptain Mewes says 'Shhhhhhh. Don't let [them] see you talking to me.'\nYou say, 'Who is 'them'?'\nCaptain Mewes says 'Those horrible Doomscale. They do such dreadful things to me, but I can [explain] later. I have some [tasks] for you if you want to help me stick a [wrench] in their work, but you can't let them know I sent you. If you are in a hurry and don't want to hear me prattle on, I need you to [disrupt] their rest, [slow] their mining, and [hamper] their research.'\nYou say, 'I'll hamper their research...'\nCaptain Mewes says 'Yes. I don't know what they are doing, but they are such terrible people that we need to do what we can to hinder their work. I have written the initial plans in your journal. We will see if we need to do more once you bring me the research. Do you need more [information]?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Research Wrecks'.\nCaptain Mewes is not happy about his treatment. He wants you to complete tasks to disrupt the Doomscale and Combine efforts. For this task he wants you to hamper their research progress.\nYou say, 'Give me more information, now'\nCaptain Mewes says 'So you'll travel to the [main platform]. Once inside, collect research [papers], set fire to the [bookshelves] with the [magical torch], and kill Combine [casters].'\nYou say, 'Where is the main platform?'\nCaptain Mewes says 'Go west off the docks. The platform is right there.'\nYou say, 'What papers?'\nCaptain Mewes says 'They should be easy to find. They are constantly working on them.'\nYou say, 'What bookshelves?'\nCaptain Mewes says 'Yeah. You know. Bookshelves. Shelves... that have books on them. Sorry. That was uncalled for. Just... my fear sometimes brings out my snarky side. Only destroy shelves on the bottom floor.'\nYou say, 'What agical torch?'\nCaptain Mewes says 'Just like all of the supplies, I do not have an unlimited amount. But if you need more, just ask me.'\nYou say, 'What casters?'\nCaptain Mewes says 'Their names are highly variable, but they should be in blue robes.'\n\n---\n\n!\n\n---\n\nEnter the main platform 0/1 (Combine Dredge)\n_Location update around 680, -665, 40 (this is the southernmost spiral tower, due north of the dock)._\nCollect research papers 0/5 (Combine Dredge)\n_\"Geomantic Research Notes\" are ground spawns on tables in the area. There are many of them, appearing as small scrolls on tables._\nSet fire to bookshelves on the bottom floor 0/5 (Combine Dredge)\n_Get close to bookshelves and right-click the \"Magical Torch\". Repeat for five total._\nKill any Combine casters that you find 0/4 (Combine Dredge)\n_Kill any four mobs with \"indagator\" or \"indagatrix\" in their name._\nDeliver research papers to Captain Mewes 0/5 (Combine Dredge)\nGive Captain Mewes a moment to skim the papers 0/1 (Combine Dredge)\n_Stand next to him until this updates._\n\n---\n\nMake your way to the far east mining machine 0/1 (Combine Dredge)\n_Location update around 1280, -3010, -30 (this is the far eastern tip of the island)._\nSet a bomb at the base of the platform 0/1 (Combine Dredge)\n_Get near a geomantic device and use the \"Self Hiding Bomb\" (received from Captain Mewes)._\n\n---\n\nMake your way to the far north mining machine 0/1 (Combine Dredge)\n_Location update around 2400, -1490, -30 (the far northeastern tip of the island)._\nSet a bomb at the base of the platform 0/1 (Combine Dredge)\n_Same as above._\n\n---\n\nMake your way to the far west mining machine 0/1 (Combine Dredge)\n_Location update around 2250, 1740, -30 (the far northwestern tip of the island)._\nSet a bomb at the base of the platform 0/1 (Combine Dredge)\n_Same as above._\n\n---\n\nKill Doomscale and Combine 0/25 (Combine Dredge)\n_Kill any 25 mobs with \"Doomscale\", \"praetor\", \"perfidus\", \"vicarum\", \"indagator\", or \"indagatrix\" in their names._\n\n---\n\nReturn to Captain Mewes with news of your success 0/1 (Combine Dredge)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n187 platinum, 5 gold",
