      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Combine Dredge [zone=1021]\n**Who:**\n- Aqusos Ulto [npc=47751]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Water Portal Spell [item=121791]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Combine Dredge: Kedge Counterblow [zone=1033]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Aqusos Ulto [npc=48588]\n- High Guard Vnayyanye [npc=47685]\n- a Doomscale cult loyalist [npc=48533]\n- a Doomscale cultist [npc=48534]\n- a Doomscale deacon [npc=48535]\n- a Doomscale enchanter [npc=48536]\n- a Doomscale guard [npc=48537]\n- a Doomscale guardian [npc=48538]\n- a Doomscale mage [npc=48539]\n- a Doomscale necromancer [npc=48540]\n- a Doomscale priest [npc=48541]\n- a Doomscale scout [npc=48542]\n- a Doomscale shadow guard [npc=48543]\n- a Doomscale shadow guardian [npc=48544]\n- a Doomscale shaman [npc=48545]\n- a Doomscale sorcerer [npc=48546]\n- a Doomscale spiritualist [npc=48547]\n- a Doomscale thaumaturge [npc=48548]\n- a Doomscale visionary [npc=48549]\n- a Doomscale warlock [npc=48550]\n- a Doomscale wizard [npc=48551]\n- a Doomscale wrathforged [npc=48552]\n- a fortis lapis operarius [npc=48553]\n- a lapis operarius [npc=48554]\n- a perfidus [npc=48555]\n- a pius vicarum spiritus [npc=48556]\n- a pius vicarum vitai [npc=48557]\n- a potens elementaribus [npc=48558]\n- a praetor lucem [npc=48560]\n- a praetor noctis [npc=48561]\n- a restive guard [npc=48564]\n- a summus indagator materia [npc=48565]\n- a summus indagator mortem [npc=48566]\n- a summus indagator vitali [npc=48567]\n- a summus indagator vocantem [npc=48568]\n- a summus indagatrix materia [npc=48569]\n- a summus indagatrix mortem [npc=48570]\n- a summus indagatrix vitali [npc=48571]\n- a summus indagatrix vocantem [npc=48572]\n- a summus praetor ledalus [npc=48573]\n- a summus praetor lucem [npc=48574]\n- a summus praetor noctis [npc=48575]\n- a vicarum spiritus [npc=48577]\n- a vicarum vitai [npc=48578]\n- an elementaribus [npc=48579]\n- an indagator materia [npc=48580]\n- an indagator mortem [npc=48581]\n- an indagator vitali [npc=48582]\n- an indagator vocantem [npc=48583]\n- an indagatrix materia [npc=48584]\n- an indagatrix mortem [npc=48585]\n- an indagatrix vitali [npc=48586]\n- an indagatrix vocantem [npc=48587]\n- water elemental [npc=48589]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 04:06:24 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n**About Heroic Adventures:**\n\\- They use the task system (steps are shown in task window, but steps are only revealed as you get to them).\n\\- Scale in difficulty, loot quality, and mob levels (based on your group's highest level player - as low as 85).\n\\- Tuned for 2-3 players and their mercenaries.\n\\- Nameds can spawn as you progress through the task (you usually have to complete a few steps before this can happen).\n\\- Collection items can drop from mobs in the instances, and ground spawns appear midway through tasks.\n\\- Expected time of completion will vary by your group's makeup (anywhere from 30-90+ minutes).\n\\- There is some variations/randomization in the task steps you'll be assigned as you progress through the task.\n**About Our Documentation of Heroic Adventures**\n\\- We only display task steps we know about.\n\\-\\-\\- If you encounter a step that isn't documented here, please post the details (or email us) and **be sure to indicate which step number it was** so that we can display it in its proper place.\n\n---\n\n_This is a heroic adventure (1-6 players) that begins with Aqusos Ulto ( **click for map image**) in Combine Dredge (underwater off the western coast)._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- None\n_Say \"task\" to request the mission and \"ready\" to zone in._\nYou say, 'Hail, Aqusos Ulto'\nAqusos Ulto says 'Air breather, I'll get right to it and not waste your time. I have a [task] for you. If you're as slow as most air breathers, then you'll simply accept my task and move on. You'll ask for more [information], though, if you have even a glimmer of intelligence.'\nYou say, 'What information?'\nAqusos Ulto says 'So that thin stuff you breathe does allow your brain to grow, at least somewhat. The regrua aren't native to Norrath. They are special servants of the gods of water and its avatar Coirnav. I have been watching the fighting, and a new one comes from the water every time one falls in combat. They will eventually overwhelm the Doomscale, though they are also very determined and resourceful themselves. I have a suspicion, but I would like you to confirm it. Explore the waters, probably not too far from here, and see if you can find the [origin].'\nYou say, 'What is their origin?'\nAqusos Ulto says 'As I said, I have a suspicion. But I need confirmation and for that I need your unbiased observation. If I provide any more information, it may influence the outcome. While I did say that you were intelligent to ask me for information, in this case I cannot comply. However, I suspect that I'll have more to say after you investigate. We can speak more then.'\nYou say, 'What task?'\nAqusos Ulto says 'Go and find the origin of the regrua in this area. When you're [ready] I'll send you to sleep until night falls so you're properly rested.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Kedge Counterblow'.\nAqusos Ulto is concerned with the activity around the Combine Dredge. It sends you to confirm a suspicion it has.\nYou say, 'Ready!'\nAqusos Ulto says 'Sleep. When you awaken you'll be ready for investigation.'\n\n---\n\n!\n\n---\n\n**NAMED MOBS**\n_\"High Guard Vnayyanye\" has a chance to spawn after the third step is completed. She has three possible spawn points, all on the small hill adjacent to the docks from Brother Island (there are three tents here). Her PHs are \"a restive guard\" in this area._\n_Known loot from this named:_\nLevel 105\nDread Vnayyanye's Censor\nVnayyanye's Transfixion\nLevel 100\n???\nLevel 95\n???\n\n---\n\nSearch for the origin of the regrua 0/1 (Combine Dredge)\n_Task Window Says:_ Search for the origin of the attacking regrua. The origin is not likely very far from the giant squid, so it would be wise to restrict your search to the west side of the zone.\n_This is a location update around 1000, 2200, -65._\nDefend yourself from the elementals 0/5 (Combine Dredge)\n_Kill five elementals (here, you'll get one spawn every 60 seconds). These mobs are mezzable._\nReturn to Aqusos Ulto and speak of the elementals 0/1 (Combine Dredge)\n**At this point in the task, collectibles spawn and a named (or its PH) has a chance to spawn.**\n\n---\n\nVenture to the main platform 0/1 (Combine Dredge)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_Location update around 700, -200, 50. See-invis mobs are about, so be careful._\nKill 10 Doomscale 0/10 (Combine Dredge)\n_Kill any 10 \"Doomscale\" mobs._\nSet a water portal spell on the top floor and run 0/1 (Combine Dredge)\n_When planting \"bombs\", get away from them quickly (or evacuate), or you'll be killed in the blast._\n\n---\n\nVenture to the ore processing platform 0/1 (Combine Dredge)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_Location update around 1400, -450, 40. No see invis mobs are reported in this area._\nKill 10 Doomscale 0/10 (Combine Dredge)\n_Kill 10 more \"Doomscale\" mobs._\nSet a water portal spell on the top floor and run 0/1 (Combine Dredge)\n_Again, move away from where you set it._\n\n---\n\nVenture to the quarry 0/1 (Combine Dredge)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_Location update around 1600, -1100, -30. There are many see-invis mobs in this area, so take care with travel._\nKill 10 beings at the mine 0/10 (Combine Dredge)\n_Anything counts for your 10 in the quarry area, except the doomscales. So clear the area around the platform when doing your 10._\nPlace the water portal spell underneath the mining device 0/1 (Combine Dredge)\n_As with previous \"place\" steps, once you place the spell, get away from it as it generates a damage aura that does around 10,000 dmg per second._\n\n---\n\nVenture to the housing platform 0/1 (Combine Dredge)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_Location update around 1100, -800, 40. Be watchful of the wrathforged mobs here as they can see invis (also a larger than normal aggro range)._\nKill 10 Doomscale of any type or Combine guards 0/10 (Combine Dredge)\n_Kill any 10 \"Doomscale\" or \"praetor\" mobs._\nSet a water portal spell on the top floor and run 0/1 (Combine Dredge)\n_Move away once set!_\n\n---\n\nReturn to Aqusos Ulto and report your success 0/1 (Combine Dredge)\n\n---\n\n**TASK REWARDS**\n\\- 387 \"Pieces of Eight\" (group currency)\n- Dread Vnayyanye's Censor [item=122125]\n- Piece of Eight [item=120483]\n- Vnayyanye's Transfixion [item=121493]",
